    notes: 'Italian womenswear label known for romantic dresses, delicate fabrics, soft tailoring and youthful interpretations of occasion dressing. Founded as Philosophy di Alberta Ferretti, it later developed separate identities under Natalie Ratabesi and Lorenzo Serafini. Its adult ready-to-wear line was integrated into Alberta Ferretti from Autumn/Winter 2025; this entry preserves the distinct label’s history.',
