      'Production paused for half a year in 1995 to limit stockists to 10 stores. Fujiwara stepped back in the late 1990s; the label continued through diffusion lines (RESONATE GOODENOUGH, GOODENOUGH IVY) and occasional capsules until it was announced over in 2017, and has since been revived only for one-off releases such as a 2020 END RACISM tee reissue and a 2025 Supreme collection.',
