    country: CountryCode.UnitedStates,
    website: 'https://www.nike.com/acg',
    instagram: 'acg',
    logo: '',
    notes: 'Nike’s outdoor line, “All Conditions Gear”: hiking boots, trail-running shoes, shell jackets, fleece, cargo trousers and packable layers. It grew from Nike’s early-1980s hiking shoes such as the Lava Dome and launched as a full footwear and apparel line in 1989, with loud colour-blocked prints, bungee lacing and rugged soles in pieces like the Air Mowabb and Air Moc. Errolson Hugh’s NikeLab ACG (2014–2018) recast it as black, pocket-heavy technical urban wear; from 2019 it returned to bright, retro trail styling. In February 2026 Nike relaunched ACG as a standalone outdoor-performance brand focused on trail running, hiking and exploration.',
