    notes: 'Australian outerwear label combining sculptural urban silhouettes with alpine performance. Voluminous down jackets, waterproof shells, snow trousers and technical layers use protective fabrics and functional detailing. Rob Maniscalco and Dellano Pereira established the project in 2016; its retail launch is commonly dated 2017, when founding partner Anati Rakocz joined.',
