    notes: 'Northamptonshire shoemaker known for Goodyear-welted brogues, Derbys, boots and loafers. Traditional leather uppers meet substantial soles, exaggerated welts and contemporary proportions, notably in the Triple Welt line. Its range also includes casual shoes and sneakers, alongside shoes made in its Rushden factory.',
