    notes: 'Danish footwear and leather-goods brand built around anatomical comfort and practical construction. Soft leather, flexible soles and direct-injection methods feature across casual shoes, boots, sandals, golf shoes and sneakers. ECCO develops leather through its own tanneries; experimental materials and designer projects extend that technical approach into more sculptural footwear and accessories.',
