    notes: 'Copenhagen womenswear label that mixes bold colour, striking prints and tailored silhouettes with a playful, slightly eccentric femininity. Dresses, occasionwear, knitwear, coats and jeans clash patterns and textures while keeping precise cuts. Its name combines the surnames of its founding creative directors, Rikke Baumgarten and Helle Hestehave, who started it in 1999 after graduating from the Royal Danish Academy of Design.',
    sources: ['https://baumundpferdgarten.com/pages/about-us', 'https://www.coggles.com/blog/fashion/baum-und-pferdgarten-interview', 'https://www.whowhatwear.com/baum-und-pferdgarten-interview'],
