    notes: 'Founded in Miami; now based in New York. Punk-rooted streetwear label built around a rat emblem and the DIY graphics of hardcore flyers, comics, video games and cult film. Graphic T-shirts, sweatshirts and caps sit alongside outerwear, workwear reworks and sneaker projects. Julian Consuegra released its first T-shirt in 2010; J.R. Ewing later joined him, and the pair moved the label to New York around 2014–2015 (accounts differ on the year).',
