    notes: 'Tokyo menswear label that grew from a white shirt and a small shop in Yutenji opened by self-taught designer Kohei Nishimura in 2006. Relaxed tailoring, shirts, knits and coats draw on workwear and office dress, with leather goods and bags in the same understated vein. Collections began at trade shows in Autumn/Winter 2007; it first showed on the runway in 2018, the year it won the Tokyo Fashion Award.',
