    notes: 'Founded in Marlborough, Massachusetts. American footwear brand known for lightweight, cushioned comfort shoes that bring walking-shoe technology to dress and casual styles. Leather and suede oxfords, loafers, boots and walking shoes such as the ProWalker and Truwalk lines use cushioned footbeds; its 1984 “Walk America” campaign built its comfort-dress reputation. Its current operating base after the 2023 sale is not confirmed.',
