    notes: 'Colourful, limited-run streetwear label known for logo T-shirts, hoodies, shorts, caps, socks and tracksuits in bright colourways, shaped by Californian and hip-hop culture. Cena Barhaghi started it as a teenager; rapper Young L of The Pack was also among its founders. Sources disagree on whether it began in the San Francisco Bay Area before moving to Los Angeles around 2011.',
