    instagram: 'battenwear',
    logo: 'battenwear.png',
    notes: 'Casual outdoor and sports clothing label that reworks details from 1960s–1990s American surf, camping and athletic gear in contemporary fits. Known for packable anoraks, fleece, nylon shells, tracksuits, rugby shirts, shorts, bags and hats in bright, sporty colour blocking. Started on a Brooklyn coffee table as Batten Sportswear, later worked from Manhattan\'s Garment District and opened a design studio in Topanga Canyon, California, in 2017. Moved its headquarters to Tokyo in 2025.',
