    notes: 'Berlin label of Stefano Pilati, launched in 2017 after his years at Saint Laurent and Zegna. Its genderless, seasonless clothes start from menswear tailoring: long, softly structured coats and jackets, wide trousers, sharply cut shirting and sheer or fluid layers, worn by men and women alike. It paused for about two years during the pandemic and returned in spring 2023 with the support of Dover Street Market Paris.',
