    notes: 'Beijing sportswear brand founded by Olympic gymnast Li Ning. It makes performance footwear and apparel for basketball, running, badminton and training, with cushioning and carbon-plate technologies in its shoes. Its lifestyle line mixes retro track jackets, tracksuits and chunky sneakers with Chinese characters, red-and-gold colourways and references to Chinese culture, popularised by its "China Li Ning" shows from 2018.',
