    website: 'https://www.anrealage.com',
    instagram: 'anrealage_official',
    logo: 'anrealage.jpg',
    notes: 'Tokyo label whose name combines “a real”, “unreal” and “age”. Its motto, “God is in the detail”, began with intricate hand-pieced patchwork and grew into collections that pair handcraft with technology: garments that change colour in sunlight, light-reactive and reflective fabrics, and exaggerated spherical, triangular or scaled-down silhouettes that question the shape of clothing. It showed in Tokyo from 2005, has presented in Paris since 2014, and launched the menswear line anrealage homme for autumn/winter 2024–25.',
    sources: ['https://www.fhcm.paris/en/house/anrealage', 'https://www.lvmhprize.com/en/anrealage', 'https://rakutenfashionweektokyo.com/en/brands/detail/anrealage/', 'https://rakutenfashionweektokyo.com/en/brands/detail/anrealage-homme/', 'https://snkrdunk.com/en/magazine/2023/03/15/anrealage-the-intricacies-of-fashion'],
