    notes: 'Milan label that began with well-cut menswear and grew into genderless collections: simple, slightly oversized shapes in bright colours and playful prints, knitwear, padded and inflatable accessories and chunky footwear, presented through art-world performances. Its Canvas project let retailers customise carryover pieces. The founders left in September 2025 and the company went into liquidation.',
