    notes: 'Family shoemaker in San Mauro Pascoli, near Rimini, that began as a small workshop making sandals for tourists and exported to Europe, the US and Asia from the 1960s. Known for sharp, glamorous women’s shoes: the Blade pump with its slim metal stiletto heel, pointed pumps, embellished sandals and over-the-knee boots in leather, suede and satin, made in its own factory, plus bags.',
