    notes: 'Womenswear label describing its style as “feminine with a twist”: girlish details such as bows, ruffles, puffed sleeves, collars and lace set against sharp tailoring, pleated skirts, schoolgirl uniforms and a sweet palette of pinks, black and white. The name joins Liushu Lei’s nickname, Shushu, with Yutong Jiang’s given name. The founders met at Donghua University and studied at London College of Fashion; the brand opened its first store at Shanghai’s JC Plaza in July 2022.',
