    notes: 'Womenswear label known for delicate, skin-baring knitwear: machine-knit lace and mesh, intricate cut-outs and stretchy, body-sculpting fabrics that wrap the body, extending into bodysuits, swimwear and shapewear. Its collections explore the relationship between body, clothing and space. Launched in New York in 2019 as RUI, later moved its operations to Shanghai, shows in Paris and renamed itself RUIbuilt in 2025. Rui Zhou won the LVMH Prize’s Karl Lagerfeld Prize in 2021.',
