    notes: 'London womenswear label built on print: dense floral textiles applied to dramatic evening gowns, couture-scale ball skirts, bows and opera coats, often worn with fully printed latex catsuits and head coverings. Everything is printed in its own studio in Peckham, which also offers print services and workshops to young designers. Launched in 2016 after Quinn’s Central Saint Martins MA; Queen Elizabeth II attended his 2018 show to present him with the first Queen Elizabeth II Award for British Design.',
