    notes: 'East London menswear brand whose motto is to “subvert the classics”: Oxford shirts, Harrington and wax jackets, knitted polos, rugby shirts and patterned jacquard knitwear reworked with unusual fabrics, updated fits and small details such as hidden embroidery. Its first product was a wax mac; it sells mainly online and through its own London shops.',
