    notes: 'Wolfgang Joop\'s Potsdam womenswear label, set up in 2003 after he left JOOP!. Silk dresses, coats and jackets in animal and mosaic prints, jersey, brocade, chiffon and lambskin give it a dramatic, romantic glamour. It showed in New York from 2004 and in Paris from 2006. It paused in 2011 after a dispute with investors, then returned with a 2012 collection in Potsdam and to Paris Fashion Week for spring 2013. Joop stepped back in 2017. It now releases Wunderkind x hessnatur capsules made from natural materials, the first in 2023.',
